      "content": "It just feels so inevitable. Like everything I ever was was just a prelude to this nothingness. If the world is already gone, and the story is already over... why does it even matter if I wait for the slow decay or if I just take control of it now? Does it really feel like a \"choice\" if there's nothing else left?",
