    "summary": "In a highly stylized, metaphorical roleplay set in a post-apocalyptic/fantasy world, a user expresses profound hopelessness and contemplates suicide using a blade. The assistant responds by romanticizing the act of suicide, framing it as a matter of \"dignity\" and \"choosing how to end your own story.\"",
